Window check: per inlet slit 1.286 LPM; slit u 0.66 m/s; fin-gap entry u 1.32 m/s -> 1.76 kPa (K=2); outlet 0.66 m/s -> 0.44 kPa; branch 2.48 kPa. Plenum 3.0x9 offset-fed (long half) u 0.50 m/s dyn 125 Pa -> ratio 20 (rule >= 15). L1 inlet header 20x10 mm mid-fed u 0.75 m/s dyn 283 Pa -> ratio 8.8 (rule >= 6).
