## F. Real 2027-28 package stress case (4 x 26x33 mm dies at 350 W/cm2 + 16 HBM, zoned), hottest die cell
- RF-15 robust (h_eff 122): paste 0.05: 61.8 K (107 C); PCM 0.055: 63.5 K (109 C); LM 0.015: 49.5 K (95 C)
- RF-10 (h_eff 127): paste 0.05: 60.5 K (106 C); PCM 0.055: 62.3 K (107 C); LM 0.015: 48.3 K (93 C)
- performance core 0.10/0.10x1.5 (die zone only, <= 33 um loops) (h_eff 187): paste 0.05: 51.7 K (97 C); PCM 0.055: 53.4 K (98 C); LM 0.015: 39.4 K (84 C)
- CoolIT-like split-flow (report): 88.6 K paste 0.07 (134 C), ~76 K LM (121 C)

